From be3a98155b502227de6c908193cb16b2c812e43b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rieki777 <rieki@pm.me>
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 13:31:00 -1000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(profile): Your Paths section + tRPC playerPaths router
 (Phase 2)

Adds the actionable hub described in QUEST_PAGE_AND_PATH_PROGRESSION_SPEC
section 8. Players see one block per declared path with three states:
  - Action checklist with concrete buttons (working toward Co-Creator)
  - Single big 'Claim N RGVoice on Hypha' button (criteria met,
    bonus waiting in private ledger)
  - Calm earned banner with the date (bonus claimed); plus the next
    tier checklist if Steward is still ahead

Claim flow reuses the existing playerProfiles.requestClaim mutation
from the four-token ledger work, so no new Hypha bridge code. The
tier_bonus_co_creator / tier_bonus_steward / tier_bonus_sage RGVoice
credits are just RGVoice in private ledger; clicking Claim packages
the redeem-tokens proposal and redirects to Hypha.

Server:
  - server/routes/playerPaths.ts: getMyPaths returns path state with
    per-path criterion checklist, derived from the same authoritative
    facts the tier detector consumes (LOI status, application status,
    quest completions, proposal votes). declarePath wraps the
    tierDetector helper for the Add a Path button. markBonusClaimed
    flips coCreatorBonusClaimedAt / stewardBonusClaimedAt timestamps.
  - server/routers.ts: mount as appRouter.playerPaths.

Client:
  - client/src/components/YourPaths.tsx: the section component.
    Includes Add a Path inline modal that opens the four-portal
    chooser for undeclared paths.
  - client/src/pages/PlayerProfile.tsx: render <YourPaths /> at the
    top of the Quests tab, above the Welcome Aboard block per spec
    section 8.1.

No schema changes, no new migrations. Phase 1 already shipped the
player_paths and tier_events tables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
